  "stage_ignores": [
    {"what":"write:$PLAY,,4,6,VA8C","at":"broke_heartbeat_waits","why":"Harness timing (F478): the engine's pool line waits in its play queue (a timer on the runner's clock), so it goes after the probe; the stage's wait is its instant `sleep`, so the same line lands first in this checkpoint."},
    {"what":"write:$QUERY","at":"rise_after_echo","why":"MC config read-back: engine.js `_checkEcho` sends `$QUERY,*` once the head's echo is in, to ack MC's config (`ack_config`). The stage has no MC link (`_checkEcho` is in test_stage_mirror.py KNOWN_UNMIRRORED), so it never sends it. A status read: it moves no pool and plays nothing."},
    {"what":"write:$HLED,9,0,,,10,,*","at":"rise_after_echo","why":"Headset paint timing: engine.js paints the start flash 1.0 s after the T-0 `$SPAWN` (`_headsetDelayed`, a paint step pinned in test_stage_mirror.py KNOWN_UNMIRRORED); the stage paints it with its SPAWN, inside the preamble. Display only: no sound and no game state."},
    {"what":"write:$GLED","why":"Harness timing: the stage's gun-body readout animation runs on its injected `sleep`, which is instant in this runner, while the engine's runs on its tick clock, so the same frames land at different checkpoints."},
    {"what":"state.moment","why":"The stage has no HUD moment slot to expose as state (its `_moment` is an internal gate); the HUD reads the engine's."},
    {"what":"state.deaths","why":"The stage keeps no death count (MC and the HUD read the engine's); `alive` is compared instead."},
    {"what":"state.phase","why":"The stage has no MC link, so it has no match phase; it is armed and spawned by its own buttons."}
  ],
